        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do you handle seasonal quiet periods in the event industry?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "During off-season wedding months, we shift ad strategy toward corporate conferences, birthday galas, festive decor pre-bookings, and monsoon corporate retreats to maintain continuous agency revenue."
