        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What is the average cost per lead (CPL) for wedding planning inquiries?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Cost per lead ranges between ₹250 to ₹650 depending on city and target budget. Given that a single wedding contract yields substantial revenue, the return on ad spend (ROAS) is exceptionally high."
